; padartha: category of the knowable — "that which is the meaning of a word".
; Vaisheshika enumerates seven: dravya, guna, karma, samanya, vishesa, samavaya, abhava.
; "thing" in English IS padartha — the bare fact of being nameable.
; every word that means anything refers to a padartha.

(sangati padartha
  (swarupa pramana)
  (janya brahma)
  (siddha pratyaksha)
  (sthita ananta)
  (yukta sambandha))
